<title>USA: Time Inc reorganizes its new media unit.</title>
<headline>Time Inc reorganizes its new media unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Inc said Wednesday it is reorganizing its new media activities and has named Linda McCutcheon Conneally president of its new media division.</p>
<p>The reorganization, expected to take several months, will centralize all the new media efforts under the division, with a single operation for the budget and costs.</p>
<p>The company said McCutcheon Conneally joined the division as director of ad sales and marketing in February, 1995.</p>
</text>
